Subject: Fast native THP video decoder (bit-identical output)

Same arithmetic and output as the reference decoder: lookup table Huffman decoding from a 64 bit
bit window (instead of one bit per iteration), DC-only blocks computed once, GX tile stores per row,
and the column IDCT pass on NEON (same operation order, fused multiply-adds as std::fma). The row passes keep
their per-row path selection, which differs in rounding. Hardware interrupt service points can be
coarsened with AURORA_THP_SERVICE_STRIDE (default: after every MCU as before). MSCHARGED_THPSTATS=1
prints one [thpstats] line per second.

